{
 "duration": 71.7714375,
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.18,
   "text": "Word of mouth is the most expensive form of marketing"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.18,
   "end": 4.52,
   "text": "that a contractor can use, you just don't see the bill."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.02,
   "end": 7.54,
   "text": "Here are four reasons why meta ads work so well"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.54,
   "end": 8.68,
   "text": "for contracting businesses."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.04,
   "end": 10.72,
   "text": "Reason number one is because your customers"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.72,
   "end": 11.52,
   "text": "are already there."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.88,
   "end": 13.4,
   "text": "Whether it's somebody who needs a new roof,"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.64,
   "end": 15.68,
   "text": "needs a new driveway, or needs HVAC replacement,"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.14,
   "end": 17.46,
   "text": "they're gonna be scrolling through Instagram"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.46,
   "end": 20.0,
   "text": "and Facebook tonight, and a meta ad puts you"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.0,
   "end": 21.9,
   "text": "right in front of them, so if they need your service,"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.02,
   "end": 22.72,
   "text": "it becomes obvious."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.34,
   "end": 25.02,
   "text": "Reason number two is because it's predictable."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.6,
   "end": 26.96,
   "text": "Word of mouth is great when it works,"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.08,
   "end": 28.96,
   "text": "but you can't rely on the most recent job"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.96,
   "end": 30.46,
   "text": "to tell someone else about your service."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.84,
   "end": 33.02,
   "text": "With meta ads, you can reliably have a flow"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.02,
   "end": 34.9,
   "text": "of customers coming in, so you never run dry."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.42,
   "end": 37.74,
   "text": "Reason number three is because of how scalable it is."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.04,
   "end": 39.82,
   "text": "At the heart of it, all meta ads are"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.82,
   "end": 42.9,
   "text": "is the ability to put $1 in and get $2 out,"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.2,
   "end": 45.56,
   "text": "meaning you put $4 in, you get $8 out,"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.82,
   "end": 46.88,
   "text": "and so and so forth."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.24,
   "end": 49.38,
   "text": "All you really need is 30 to 50 bucks a day"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.38,
   "end": 50.96,
   "text": "to get started, and you can start seeing"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.96,
   "end": 52.4,
   "text": "more customers the next day."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.02,
   "end": 54.46,
   "text": "Businesses used to be able to put out"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.46,
   "end": 56.78,
   "text": "a couple ads a month and test various creatives,"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.78,
   "end": 58.16,
   "text": "but because we now have AI,"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.16,
   "end": 61.48,
   "text": "you can test 10, 20, 30, 50 different ad types"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.48,
   "end": 63.88,
   "text": "in a given month and find exactly what's working."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.22,
   "end": 65.94,
   "text": "My name's JT, and I help contractors"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.94,
   "end": 67.62,
   "text": "get more customers through meta ads,"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.98,
   "end": 70.0,
   "text": "so if you wanna learn more about how I do what I do,"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.08,
   "end": 71.58,
   "text": "just shoot me a DM and I'll walk you through it."
  }
